 Consolidated AI access details across organization and project\nsettings.\n- AI functionality now validates project ownership and disables access\nfor mismatched or HIPAA-sensitive projects.\n- AI responses include plan, region, opt-in status, sensitivity,\nauthorization, and advanced model access information.\n\n- **Bug Fixes**\n- Improved fail-closed behavior when project or organization data is\nmissing or inconsistent.\n- Updated AI generation, feedback, rate, and policy flows to\nconsistently apply consolidated access settings.\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->","tree":{"sha":"b34fbeab39acbf2ffd148231f553f25dd6296a99","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/supabase/supabase/git/trees/b34fbeab39acbf2ffd148231f553f25dd6296a99"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/supabase/supabase/git/commits/b04d14856ab0c3db99cbf98389baa18fb4467450","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqef2XCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA1wsQAEzo/8EBbYkwnF6LciiWf8PR\neMVQBhEYI3osyExEpjEPF5tlMeUVl1MpDXpOIr04mdRez7ga7V3/B2MAyMnAQOJV\n+FAx9YVg+SUCij5t5XmXLc0EQLmnPRMlfVuy2MoN+Xz3rhbzddOFkCmOFlU1lGWZ\nZN6B1IOe5fF5UbEQA+n4w1kBgYo4j+/drY7I/JUrhek+UayoNL8DO587ha3vic0g\nU+A+yxxUSt6MxRj3/vwzU/CkvkMHhAEoNlYlzml3SfMMidWPyrKfk54NkwA8jBXx\nOpZtYzEuqXfXQZUWUP/CD7D20zj8iwP8WOqIhPhpbOKXBwzzfUL8FMel35CWDS4p\nJAX1aYwdTY3k7YsSmlJI04JkMXZUn3UWAjtQuWhBFWdCPrNsKH8OsHGT93ENfonH\nNrKyMVbLBO4wQYzBHF5OZnIGi/a9i9kzAblgHARtcdzzFdd85NlkbTRCjc6ASw7O\nMah19klaLI3FvJIpkvbJLWLQaAqKiblVXaaAD67U2jMJgbYugB57h28h6tamERdE\n4QRPAUXlFdE99MFdjNaHZsA67R1GeF1bfwUSPdBUBaEFwV7RYTV9sFmTwFMOpYsD\nUp0C2FWF0anhuq0CXDuMIUqzMLd+/nVdSUiBL6zEvznhQKZYoWpThBegs1vjzMP1\nIBJA34eBxoIZGy3EuDVZ\n=jTPn\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree b34fbeab39acbf2ffd148231f553f25dd6296a99\nparent 957e9fec6717810d96ac2b2d92e013f9a81e02fa\nauthor Ali Waseem <waseema393@gmail.com> 1786379671 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786379671 -0600\n\nResolve AI opt-in and tracing settings server-side (#48855)\n\nThe AI endpoints resolved organization and project settings\nindependently and applied them together without confirming they belonged\nto the same pairing. Consolidates both into a single `getAIDetails` that\nreconciles them and falls back to the most restrictive posture when\nunconfirmed, and applies the HIPAA sensitivity gate to the opt-in level,\nwhich previously only existed on the client.\n\nFixes FE-4110\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai\n-->\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n- **New Features**\n- Consolidated AI access details across organization and project\nsettings.\n- AI functionality now validates project ownership and disables access\nfor mismatched or HIPAA-sensitive projects.\n- AI responses include plan, region, opt-in status, sensitivity,\nauthorization, and advanced model access information.\n\n- **Bug Fixes**\n- Improved fail-closed behavior when project or organization data is\nmissing or inconsistent.\n- Updated AI generation, feedback, rate, and policy flows to\nconsistently apply consolidated access settings.\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->","verified_at":"2026-08-10T16:34:35Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/supabase/supabase/commits/b04d14856ab0c3db99cbf98389baa18fb4467450","html_url":"https://github.com/supabase/supabase/commit/b04d14856ab0c3db99cbf98389baa18fb4467450","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/supabase/supabase/commits/b04d14856ab0c3db99cbf98389baa18fb4467450/comments","author":{"login":"awaseem","id":8704380,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3MDQzODA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8704380?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/awaseem","html_url":"https://github.com/awaseem","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/awaseem/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/awaseem/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api